---
source: tests/cli_golden.rs
expression: help
---
Run the agent (default when no subcommand is given)

Usage: aura run [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --mode <MODE>
          Session mode for the interactive terminal. Overrides the daemon default (`AURA_DEFAULT_MODE`); the kernel denies any tool call the mode does not allow

          Possible values:
          - agent: Full unrestricted operation subject to user permissions
          - plan:  Read + markdown writes + read-only subprocesses
          - ask:   Read-only
          - debug: Read + sandboxed probes only

      --ui <UI>
          UI mode (terminal or none)

          Possible values:
          - terminal: Full terminal UI (default)
          - none:     No UI, run as swarm server
          
          [default: terminal]

      --theme <THEME>
          Theme (cyber, matrix, synthwave, minimal)
          
          [default: cyber]

  -d, --dir <DIR>
          Working directory

      --provider <PROVIDER>
          Model provider: `anthropic` (local Ollama models + aura-router) or `mock`
          
          [default: anthropic]

  -v, --verbose
          Enable verbose output

      --allow-unrestricted-full-access
          Permit FullAccess sessions to bypass command allowlists

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
